{{Enemy Infobox|The Maw}}
The Maw is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found exclusively in [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|The Maw}}
Always starts with {{Int|The Maw|Roar}}. Afterwards it has a 50/50 chance of using either {{Int|The Maw|Slam}} or {{Int|The Maw|Nom Nom}}.

'''After using {{Int|The Maw|Drool}}:''' 50/50 split between {{Int|The Maw|Slam}} and {{Int|The Maw|Nom Nom}}.

'''After using {{Int|The Maw|Slam}}:''' 50/50 split between {{Int|The Maw|Nom Nom}} and {{Int|The Maw|Drool}}.

'''After using {{Int|The Maw|Nom Nom}}:''' Always uses {{Int|The Maw|Drool}}.

== Found With ==
=== Act 3 ===
* Solo

== Trivia ==
* The Maw is the only enemy whose Max HP does not change based on [[Ascension]] level.
* The Maw appears in the artwork of {{C|Weave}}.

